{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29702","headline":"韩同年新居饯韩西迎家室戏赠 · 李商隐","name":"韩同年新居饯韩西迎家室戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"籍籍征西万户侯，新缘贵婿起朱楼。\n一名我漫居先甲，千骑君翻在上头。\n云路招邀回彩凤，天河迢遰笑牵牛。\n南朝禁脔无人近，瘦尽琼枝咏四愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}